 "details": "Rock am Ring's twin festival with the same line-up in a different day order; line-up nearly complete after the third wave (13 Nov 2026). Friday 4 June: Die Toten Hosen, Turnstile, Faith No More, Bad Religion, Bullet For My Valentine, I Prevail, Nothing But Thieves, Clutch, Skindred. Saturday: Bring Me The Horizon, Parkway Drive, Evanescence, Amon Amarth, Arch Enemy, Lorna Shore, Motionless In White, Jinjer. Sunday 6 June: blink-182, Falling in Reverse, Billy Talent, Beartooth, Pendulum, Simple Plan, Killswitch Engage, The Prodigy (very special guest). All three day tickets sold out; weekend tickets with General or Green Camping still on sale; public transport included.",
